title: Start
position: -165,-398
---
A cold sad expanse of memories is in front of you, mixed, mashed, tangled in each other.
Just waiting to be recalled, to be relived and be warmed again. 

from far inside this confused mess, a voice echos...

???: Hi there, It's been a long time.

-> What?
-> Who?

    ???: No no don't fight it. If you do it's just gonna be harder, just try to relax...
    and remember.

    something starts warming up in you. little by little like a ice melting under the heat.

    From the darkness a small chamber starts to take shape. A woman is screaming, screams of pain while she pushes.
    A wail cuts the air, a sigh of relief. 
    A nurse carries away a new born. 
    while a doctor rushes to the woman. 
    ...
    A man is standing outside a metal door,
    He's waiting, when the same nurse comes back. 

    -> The man will ask about the woman.
    <<jump ChA>>
    -> The man will ask about the child.
    <<jump ChB>>
